==Trivia==
*Owlbrow's Japanese name, Mayu-ge Dori (まゆげどり), can be literally translated as "Eyebrows Bird".
*He and his variants are the only [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies to walk most of the time, with his description even breaking the 4th wall to poke fun at this.
**At 78 years old, Owlbrow is 1 year younger than [[Pterowl Hazuku]], who is 79, and is implied to have come to be when Owlbrow could no longer tolerate being regarded as a Floating enemy.
*Prior to [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]], Owlbrow was a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/Floating enemy.

